<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Jenny Selegey — Product Designer</title>
<meta name="description" content="Jenny Selegey — product designer working on personalization, user agency, and the systems that decide who you are.">

